      ],
      "text": "(75) prior to death in 45.8% of cases (95% CI: 32.6–59.1)  . Ensuring early detection and timely treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.96218490600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        471.6886291503906,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "of TB among people living with HIV is of paramount importance for reducing mortality.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.3914184570312,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "A key component of the HIV care cascade is the WHO-recommended four-symptom screen (W4SS)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.497314453125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "for adults and adolescents living with HIV, comprising screening for a current cough, fever, night sweats",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.958672523498535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.3991088867188,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "or weight loss. This has been the only WHO-recommended TB screening strategy for people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.6090698242188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "with HIV since its introduction in 2011, and it is recommended for use at every patient encounter with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98488998413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.3007354736328,
        527.169677734375,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(19). a health care worker  Designed primarily for ruling out active TB prior to the initiation of TPT, due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.996199607849121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4277954101562,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "to its high negative predictive value, the development of the W4SS was informed by a meta-analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4013671875,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "of individual patient data (IPD) from in observational studies conducted prior to 2010 and prior to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        191.9007110595703,
        527.4242553710938,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "(76) the scale up of ART  . However, a more recent systematic review found that the pooled sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4322509765625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "of the W4SS among people living with HIV who were on ART was 51% (95% CI: 28.4–73.2) and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.3007354736328,
        527.40478515625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(77) specificity was 70.7% (95% CI: 47.7–86.4)  . For people living with HIV who were not on ART, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4771118164062,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity was 89.3% (95% CI: 82.6–93.9), and the specificity was 27.2% (95% CI: 17.3–40). In another",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999350547790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3880004882812,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "study, the W4SS was found to have 42.9% sensitivity among pregnant women in Kenya attending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        257.90069580078125,
        342.3246765136719,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "(78) services for prevention of mother to child transmission  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4288940429688,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, a systematic literature review and meta-analysis of IPD was undertaken to assess further",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.2893676757812,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "the accuracy of the W4SS among people living with HIV overall and within important subgroups",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.385986328125,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "and to identify other screening tools and strategies that would enhance TB detection among people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.43310546875,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV. Screening tools and strategies reviewed by the GDG included the use of C-reactive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.639892578125,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "protein (CRP), CXR and mWRDs as stand-alone tests, as well as in combination with the W4SS.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.4068603515625,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Culture was the reference standard for assessing the accuracy of the different screening strategies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.43017578125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations apply to adults and adolescents aged 10 years and older living with HIV;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        380.9501037597656,
        374.6886291503906,
        434.4101257324219,
        389.0436096191406
      ],
      "text": "section 3.4",
