        374.7986145019531,
        436.8774719238281,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "for recommendation on children under 10 years living with HIV see  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.30120849609375,
        331.7736511230469,
        415.033203125
      ],
      "text": "3.3.1.1 WHO-recommended four-symptom screen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.2411193847656,
        527.4070434570312,
        436.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "The 2020 meta-analysis of IPD included 23 studies of 16 269 participants living with HIV, all of which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.44110107421875,
        527.38818359375,
        449.8841247558594
      ],
      "text": "reviewed the accuracy of the W4SS. The studies primarily focused on pulmonary TB disease. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.64111328125,
        527.2532348632812,
        463.0841369628906
      ],
      "text": "unweighted average TB prevalence among participants within these studies was 9.2%, ranging from 1%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.8412170410156,
        527.5655517578125,
        476.28424072265625
      ],
      "text": "to 26%; and 52% of people living with HIV screened positive on the W4SS. The sensitivity of the W4SS",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983588218688965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.0411071777344,
        527.4155883789062,
        489.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "among all people living with HIV was 83% (95% CI: 74–89) and specificity was 38% (95% CI: 25–53).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.2411193847656,
        527.4189453125,
        502.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "Estimates of the accuracy of the W4SS in different subgroups of people living with HIV are shown in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.33111572265625,
        106.02320098876953,
        515.6860961914062
      ],
      "text": "Table 5",
